110px'><div style='font-size:24px;margin-bottom:8px'>\u26a1</div><div style='color:#ffa657;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold'>Impact Analysis</div><div style='color:#8b949e;font-size:11px;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.5'>Job \u2192 Network \u2192 GPU \u00b7 Bad job cascades \u00b7 XID 94 \u2192 50 GPUs down \u00b7 RAID slowdown</div><div style='margin-top:8px;font-size:10px;color:#ff8800'>\u2192 Click to open</div></div></a><a href='http://10.127.28.83:3000/d/nvis-security-audit' target='_blank' style='text-decoration:none'><div style='background:#150a1f;border:1px solid #bc8cff;border-radius:8px;padding:16px;min-height:110px'><div style='font-size:24px;margin-bottom:8px'>\ud83d\udd12</div><div style='color:#d2a8ff;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold'>Security Audit</div><div style='color:#8b949e;font-size:11px;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.5'>DMS cert expiry \u00b7 LDAP \u00b7 SSH logins \u00b7 Service health \u00b7 License compliance</div><div style='margin-top:8px;font-size:10px;color:#bc8cff'>\u2192 Click to open</div></div></a></div>",
